therefore only allows atomic operations. With the parallel code, we have a situation where
multiple threads are actually trying to write to the file and causing an exception. We need
to make sure that the code runs in parallel as fast as possible but also maintains atomicity
while writing to the file. We need to modify the preceding code using a lock statement.
